# WooCommerce Meta — Skaflow Contracts

Conventions are in `.cursor/rules/sf-commerce.mdc`. This file is the data
contract for this specific store.

The rebuild reads the **same keys and formats** the legacy Woodmart/JetEngine
site wrote. Normalise on save only. No bulk migration without an explicit
request.

## Product post meta

| Key | Format | Admin UI |
|---|---|---|
| `parts` | Serialized array of product ID strings | `WooCommerce_Admin`, `woocommerce_product_options_related` → `woocommerce_admin_process_product_object` |
| `dimensions` | WYSIWYG HTML | ACF `group_product_additional_information` |
| `care` | WYSIWYG HTML | ACF |
| `additional_information` | WYSIWYG HTML | ACF |
| `_woodmart_swatches_attribute` | Taxonomy slug | No UI — cheap read fallback only |

## Variation post meta

| Key | Format | Admin UI |
|---|---|---|
| `wd_additional_variation_images_data` | CSV of attachment IDs, no spaces | `WooCommerce_Admin`, `woocommerce_variation_options` → `woocommerce_save_product_variation` |

POST key: `wd_additional_variation_images[{variation_id}]`.

**Save safety:** if the POST key is absent entirely, do not delete existing meta.

Admin assets: `assets/js/variation-gallery-admin.js`,
`assets/css/variation-gallery-admin.css`.

**Not present on this site:** `woodmart_variation_gallery_data` on the parent
product (the older Woodmart method).

## Term meta — swatches

On `pa_*` attribute terms. This data persisted after Woodmart's removal. Only
`pa_colour` has populated swatch data here.

| Key | Format |
|---|---|
| `color` | CSS colour, often `rgb(r,g,b)` |
| `image` | Array with an `id`, or a URL string |
| `not_dropdown` | `'1'` or empty |
| `pa_term_hint` | Text/HTML |

ACF group: `group_pa_colour_swatch_fields.json`. Admin column:
`lib/class-attribute-swatch-preview-column.php`.

## Woodmart options → hardcoded equivalents

Do not call Woodmart option APIs — the plugin is not a dependency. Hardcode:

| Legacy option | Rebuild value |
|---|---|
| `grid_swatches_attribute` | `pa_colour` |
| `woodmart_pa_colour_swatch_*` | style 3, dis_style 3, shape round, size m |

## Verification

```bash
ddev wp post meta get 1000438 wd_additional_variation_images_data
ddev wp post meta get <product_id> parts --format=json
```

Sample variation-gallery record: **1000438**. This ID is environment-specific —
confirm it exists before relying on it outside local.

